{"id":"oman-4x4","title":"Oman by 4x4","who":"Classic route · mountains, desert and coast","when":"October to March","vehicle":"4x4, often with a rooftop tent, 8–14 days","kind":"4x4","color":"#be123c","summary":"A loop of about 1,400 km from Muscat: the forts and souq of Nizwa, the gravel road up Jebel Shams to the edge of the \"Grand Canyon of Arabia\", the dunes of the Wahiba Sands, palm-filled wadis to swim in, turtles at Ras al-Jinz and dhow yards at Sur. Wild camping is a big part of it.","sources":[{"label":"Mapping Megan: wild camping in Oman, 7-day 4WD itinerary","url":"https://mappingmegan.com/wild-camping-oman-7-day-4wd-itinerary-self-drive-roadtrip-without-a-guide"},{"label":"Ountravela: Oman off-road itinerary and GPS tracks","url":"https://ountravela.com/en/overlanding-off-road-trip/oman-travel-map-4x4/"}],"approximate":"A common loop; the roads are the router's choice.","km":1047,"bbox":[57.1367,21.9295,59.828,23.6245],"stops":[{"name":"Muscat","place":"Muscat, Oman","at":[23.6124,58.5938],"text":"The Grand Mosque and the corniche, then inland.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Al_Alam_Palace.jpg/500px-Al_Alam_Palace.jpg","page":"Muscat","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Al_Alam_Palace.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Nizwa","place":"Nizwa, Oman","at":[22.9324,57.5311],"text":"A great round fort and the Friday goat market.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Nizwa_%287%29.jpg/500px-Nizwa_%287%29.jpg","page":"Nizwa","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nizwa_%287%29.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Jebel Shams","place":"Jebel Shams, Oman","at":[23.2372,57.2633],"text":"Gravel to the rim of Wadi Ghul, the \"Grand Canyon of Arabia\"; a balcony walk along it.","source":{"label":"Mapping Megan","url":"https://mappingmegan.com/wild-camping-oman-7-day-4wd-itinerary-self-drive-roadtrip-without-a-guide"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Jebel_Shams.jpg/500px-Jebel_Shams.jpg","page":"Jebel Shams","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jebel_Shams.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Misfat al-Abriyeen","place":"Misfat al Abriyeen","at":[23.1406,57.3114],"text":"A mountain village of mud houses and falaj water channels.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Misfat_Al_Abriyeen_Village%2C_Oman.jpg/500px-Misfat_Al_Abriyeen_Village%2C_Oman.jpg","page":"Misfat al Abriyeen","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Misfat_Al_Abriyeen_Village%2C_Oman.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Wahiba Sands","place":"Bidiyah, Oman","at":[22.1378,58.7925],"text":"Into the dunes for a night at a desert camp."},{"name":"Wadi Bani Khalid","place":"Wadi Bani Khalid","at":[21.9815,59.5719],"text":"Green pools in the rocks for a swim.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Wadi_Bani_Khalid%2C_Om%C3%A1n%2C_2024-08-17%2C_DD_51.jpg/500px-Wadi_Bani_Khalid%2C_Om%C3%A1n%2C_2024-08-17%2C_DD_51.jpg","page":"Wadi Bani Khalid","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wadi_Bani_Khalid%2C_Om%C3%A1n%2C_2024-08-17%2C_DD_51.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Ras al-Jinz","place":"Ras al Jinz","at":[22.4188,59.83],"text":"Green turtles coming ashore to nest at night."},{"name":"Sur","place":"Sur, Oman","at":[22.5693,59.5296],"text":"Dhow-building yards, then Wadi Shab on the way back.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Oman%2C_Sur_%28city_view%29.jpg/500px-Oman%2C_Sur_%28city_view%29.jpg","page":"Sur, Oman","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Oman%2C_Sur_%28city_view%29.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Back in Muscat","place":"Muscat, Oman","at":[23.612